4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e9Kvdjv2EosQ7kNvwHLPTGN&_nc_oc=AdrMucaB6glNMl-bFqA1Xe3JHZLHSusO0GFKjchia6xuojTZjrPoffrb3zMEMg-8cDw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7p-lQN6BTRwhquud7q26JG7jYAsjcujB0i1u6m4kLlDg&oe=6A0DB154"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P1JGX4F1oOcQ7kNvwFm2mKL&_nc_oc=Adoy0BFGVLUmn6Y5m5mkv7DusZiAWSZqPhEYd75f4wVs9tftknch9NeLMy_lF3w17NA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5D24EJEtuxEsrmyknnhkx9C7fHe24gqDHwiVKZ1UautA&oe=6A0DB632"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DJxENHrMSqUQ7kNvwFVmFqF&_nc_oc=AdrfCI0p-u6kzp-E4FgjWQF5EAjLboBtamsfgdOYJJOD0CvuWLJ3hIWYGOnUF7_nsDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7szWAgS2n5D84FJpVMyF69eAOubwZeRQnv6TGEeZCnag&oe=6A0DC3D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p